{"version":1,"key":"quest:16","content":{"id":16,"title":"CSS 的加载是异步的吗？表现在什么地方？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:16","type":"quest","id":16},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"CSS 同步阻塞渲染及异步加载方法","meta":"","excerpt":"通常加载 CSS 是同步阻塞的，在解析到 CSS 资源时，会阻止已处理内容的渲染，直至 CSS 加载并解析完成，构建 CSSOM 树，和 DOM 树形成渲染树后绘制到页面上。 假设 CSS 是异步加载的，那么就会出现一开始没样式，然后闪一下出现样式的情况（Flash of Unstyle Content，FOUC），这","target":{"key":"card:569","type":"card","id":569},"citeKey":"card:569"}],"trail":[{"time":1744701036908,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1744725801127,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1744725801127,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"createTime":1744701036908,"updateTime":1744701036908,"resolvedTime":1744725801127},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1744701036908}}